        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Captain's audio log number two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "Current time, 0915 hours. Weather, cloudy. We have returned to the Soubo mountain range, and are currently continuing our advance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since the last recording, I along with Operator Noir Corne have encountered a series of unexpected situations while executing our mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "We first engaged in combat with an unknown lifeform... a Rathalos. We were not successful in this endeavor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "Upon arriving at the village, our usual investigation into the source of the Oripathy outbreak was met with significant resistance from the locals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their reasons are still unclear, though from the medical tests conducted, it seems that the villagers have been in contact with Originium for an extended period of time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "In summing up the clues we've gathered so far, we have determined a course of action: we will continue to track the Rathalos into the forest to try and pinpoint the source of Originium contamination. Progress so far has been poor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh\u2014The thicket here is too dense. Corne, hand me an axe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you just hand me? I said to give me an axe, not\u2014what is this...uneven... and squirming...ah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "An Originium slug?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium slug?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why was there one on my hand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy01"
    },
    {
        "text": "The slug has no bones... and a very hard carapace, very good! I like it very meowch!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Corne\u2014where did you go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey mew, take a look. The seeds of this plant burst out with just a touch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "They flew so far away, pawbably to extend the range of theirs dispersal... reminds me of a Blastnut.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This might be related to the Rathalos's whereabouts...Oh! Could it be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm pawsitive that is completely unrelated to our search.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Breathes deeply)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We are currently travelling with some additional companions from another continent that bear some resemblance to Felines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy01"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's Felynes to mew!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They call themselves Felynes with a Y, and possess information on the Rathalos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "With the help of these Felynes and the extensive problem-solving expertise of Rhodes Island Operations Team A4, I believe we will soon unravel this incident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yato! This way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, over here! The Rathalos went this way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But you said it was this way earlier...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Those were old tracks, it left new ones here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#3$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "jump",
        "times": 2,
        "power": 30,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph! Anyway, just head this way! Mew are as stupid as a Kestodon!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#3$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you say? What's a Kestodon\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#3$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_punch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "jump",
        "times": 1,
        "power": 30,
        "xpos": -40,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Augh! Who chopped down the tree here?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
        "name2": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A slow monster that purretty much always charges around and gets stuck in trees!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We're close to getting to the bottom of this. Recording complete.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "Corne. Felynes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up, we've been walking for two hours, and have yet to see even a glimpse of the Rathalos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you'd like to continue your argument, I'll send you both back to that cave to have a nice chat with all the Originium slugs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
