    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekolow"
    },
    {
        "text": "Smithy, keep your meows down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrow?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Look over there, on the flowers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "In the underbrush?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Undoubtedly, there must be\u2014yes! A whole bunch of tiny, squirming, endemic lifeforms hidden beneath!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a little closer\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hidden within the shadows, danger creeps closer, with the flying insects none the wiser...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The concealed predator holds for just a meowment, fur its chance is close at paw! The time is... now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "One expels a puff of smoke, and the insects are wobbling, are they about to fall?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrrow... head hurts...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "A\u2014Achoo\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoangry"
    },
    {
        "text": "Smithy! Look at what you did! Scared them all away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Suddenly so sleepy... so many meowterials dancing in the clouds...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Even the flying insects dropped from that puff of smoke... could it be one of its properties?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "I shall note this down... a new kind of endemic lifeform that can cause drowsiness in those affected. Purrphaps it may even be helpful in hunts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tiny endemic life and flying insects, flying insects and nectar, Meownsters and Hunters... the resemblance is too much to bear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrrow... just like...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "lfte",
        "type": "jump",
        "times": 2,
        "power": 30,
        "xpos": -200,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Smithy. I've been noticing this ever since we came here, but while I'm pawsitive that Terra is a totally different world, it shares so many similarities with ours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether it be the villagers or creatures I've observed, a closer look has revealed that we share meowch more commonalities than diffurences.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our Ecological Survey in the forest so far has led me to the conclusion that while the endemic life here appears diffurent from the ones we are used to back home, the way things work is exactly the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Plants, herbivores, carnivores... predator and prey constitute the basis of most biological relationships.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The degree of similarity between these two worlds... is simply remeowkable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "As I've said befur, our prior knowledge is adequate to understand this world, fur there is no fundamental diffurence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can also record the Rathalos's activities here up close, and become Terra's top ecological researcher.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy02"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm the purrime scholar after all! Meowhahaha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be an ecological researcher here, Originium will definitely be a factor to consider.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium, mew say? I did hear Noir Corne mention it multipaw times, but I have not whiskered any obvious influence...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think it's that meowch of a problem. If you simply take a look at people like Noir Corne, they're pawbably just too dumb to understand how it truly works, purrphaps the rocks have their own special qualities even!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "However, this forest does indeed raise some concerns in me. It feels like something's missing, but I can't be sure what.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What could it pawssibly be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Smithy, what do mew think\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Noir Corne? Why are you here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Me? Should I not be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
    },
    {
        "text": "Smithy? Mrow? Where did mew go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
