        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If I recall correctly, is that it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go take a look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Careful, don't step on it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you're right. Straight from the pages of 'The Originium Slug's Guide to Terran Wildlife'... Vanilla reminded us of this countless times before we left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Top three creatures to worry about in the forests!' 'An aerial nightmare you definitely want to avoid!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sporting dazzling silver and black feathers and an appearance from the front as dark as a ghost in the night...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you see patches of black and silver feathers on the ground, it means there's a stinkfowl nest nearby.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the moment you step into their territory, only one thing awaits you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Yato! Noir Corne! I can't find Smithy anywhere!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Where did you lose sight of him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were just meowing about, and he\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Corne... did you hear that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, sounds like wings flapping in the sky to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're getting more intense...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "S-Should I go take a look?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy01"
    },
    {
        "text": "Meow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arty! Where have you been?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy01"
    },
    {
        "text": "Noir Corne! Fur mew!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? This is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, don't just skedaddle! Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Corne... isn't that...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't mean\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stinkfowl eggs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
