    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They got stopped over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm beat...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you want some water?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, don't come any closer to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put your shield up so it can block the smell a little... I'll toss the bottle over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yato...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Corne, I hope you understand that it's best for us to keep our distance for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
